    "detail": {
      "id": 1320202,
      "name": "[Dexterity] Zone Energy Shield",
      "desc": "When in combat, all squad members <color=#2BAD00>gain 1 Dexterity Charge</color> (up to 32) every 0.5s. When taking DMG and losing HP, all <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Charge</color> will be consumed. When Dexterity Charge consumed is greater or equal to 8/16/24, <color=#2BAD00>Dexterity State</color> will last for 2/4/8s. With 32 <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Charge</color>, all Charge is consumed when an enemy is hit, <color=#2BAD00>entering Dexterity State</color> for 16s. In <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity State</color>, all squad members' <color=#2BAD00>ATK is increased by 60%</color>. When an attack hits an enemy, <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Curse</color> is inflicted on the target. <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Curse</color> is calculated when exiting <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity State</color>, dealing <color=#2BAD00>additional DMG to enemies equal to 10% of DMG accumulated</color> during <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Curse</color>.",
